## B. Beneficiaries of International Protection

## 1. Granting of the Right of Asylum

According to article 3(1) of Law No. 27, the right of asylum is guaranteed to foreigners and stateless persons who are persecuted or seriously threatened with persecution, as a result of activities carried out in the state of their nationality or of their habitual residence in favor of democracy, social and national liberation, peace between peoples, freedom, and human rights.4

